  "description": "After years of unrequited love, Angelica finally marries Lord Dominic, but he remains cold and distant. To make matters worse, Angelica’s uncle selfishly betrays the family. As endless debt and sorrow pain the poor girl, she tragically decides to end it all... Yet, she somehow wakes up in the past, returning to the day she proposed to Dominic. Was it all a dream? One thing is clear—Angelica won’t commit the same mistakes again. \n\n*“I don’t love you anymore, Dominic. Let’s break off the engagement!”*\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\nNote: Includes one extra chapter.",
